---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '@/components/sections/PageHero.astro';
import { site } from '@/data/site';
---
<!-- Internal draft for lawyer review only. -->
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Draft privacy notice describing how Daybytes handles enquiries, training applications, and job applications. Pending legal review." noindex overlayHeader>
  <PageHero eyebrow="Legal" title="Privacy Policy" intro="This page is a draft for legal review before launch." breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Privacy Policy', href: '/privacy' }]} />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-[760px] px-4 py-16 sm:px-6">
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <p><strong>Draft:</strong> This policy is a working draft for lawyer review and should not be treated as final legal advice.</p>
      <p>{site.name} is a technology and training business based in Lagos, Nigeria. We collect personal information when visitors contact us, enquire about services, apply for training, or apply for jobs.</p>
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Contact details such as name, email, phone number and message content.</li>
        <li>Booking information from Calendly or other scheduling tools.</li>
        <li>Career application details, including CV uploads or links.</li>
        <li>Technical information such as browser type, pages viewed, and IP address when needed for security and analytics.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Why we use it</h2>
      <p>We use personal data to answer enquiries, provide services, schedule consultations, manage training applications, assess job applications, and improve our website and communications.</p>
      <h2>Lawful basis</h2>
      <p>We rely on consent, contract performance, legitimate business interests, and legal requirements where applicable. We will not process data beyond what is necessary for the stated purpose.</p>
      <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
      <p>We may share data with hosting providers, email delivery providers, scheduling providers, and analytics tools where needed. We may also share limited information required by law or a regulator.</p>
      <p><strong>[TO CONFIRM]</strong> Confirm the final list of third parties including Brevo, Calendly, Cloudflare, analytics provider, and any CRM or storage tool.</p>
      <h2>International transfers</h2>
      <p>Where data is processed outside Nigeria, we will put appropriate safeguards in place and only transfer information where needed for delivery or support.</p>
      <h2>Retention</h2>
      <p><strong>[TO CONFIRM]</strong> Confirm data retention periods for enquiries, applications, training records, and website logs.</p>
      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>Visitors may request access, correction, deletion, restriction, objection, or withdrawal of consent where applicable. If you are in the UK or EU, you may also have GDPR rights. To exercise any request, contact us at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
      <h2>Complaints</h2>
      <p>If you want to complain to the Nigeria Data Protection Commission, you can do so through the official channels and also contact us first so we can try to resolve the issue.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>{site.legalName}<br />{site.address.street}<br />{site.address.locality}, {site.address.region}<br /><a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a><br /><a href={site.phone.href}>{site.phone.display}</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
